from NBC's "Will &amp; Grace,"

00:00:05.538 --> 00:00:07.841 align:start size:94% position:6%
which returns for
its second revival season

00:00:07.841 --> 00:00:09.175 line:92%
this Thursday at 9:00 p.m.

00:00:09.175 --> 00:00:10.043 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Let's take a look.

00:00:10.043 --> 00:00:12.879 size:78% position:39% line:92%
-Grace, is Will here?

00:00:21.021 --> 00:00:23.390 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-I'll get him.

00:00:27.027 --> 00:00:27.961 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Hey. What's up?

00:00:27.961 --> 00:00:31.598 align:start size:94% position:6%
