on the pill bottle says

00:00:41.808 --> 00:00:42.575 size:88% position:44% line:92%
do not mix with alcohol.

00:00:42.575 --> 00:00:46.046
-Please welcome back to the show
Eric McCormack, everyone.

00:00:46.046 --> 00:00:48.548 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:48.548 --> 00:00:58.558 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
♪♪♪♪

00:00:58.558 --> 00:01:05.498 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
♪♪♪♪

00:01:05.498 --> 00:01:07.233 align:start size:94% position:6%
Welcome back.
-Nice to be back.

00:01:07.233 --> 00:01:09.769 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I have to say,
that really speaks to the fact

00:01:09.769 --> 00:01:10.570 line:92%
that you work on a classic show.

00:01:10.570 --> 00:01:13.873
With very little context, that
was an extremely funny clip.

00:01:13.873 --> 00:01:14.607 size:84% position:42% line:92%
-Thank you. Well, yeah.

00:01:14.607 --> 00:01:17.243 align:start size:94% position:6%
All you have to do
is talk about Karen's boobs.

00:01:17.243 --> 00:01:17.844 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah, exactly.

00:01:17.844 --> 00:01:19.479 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And everybody
is paying attention.

00:01:19.479 --> 00:01:20.680 line:92%
-Well, last time you were here

00:01:20.680 --> 00:01:22.148 align:start size:94% position:6%
you had just done
a mini reunion.

00:01:22.148 --> 00:01:23.983 align:start size:94% position:6%
Sort of small special
"Will &amp; Grace."

00:01:23.983 --> 00:01:25.518 align:start size:94% position:6%
This is before
the revival season.

00:01:25.518 --> 00:01:27.554 size:81% position:41%
-It was the only thing
we were going to do.

00:01:27.554 --> 00:01:29.956 align:start size:94% position:6%
We were going to do
this 10-minute video

00:01:29.956 --> 00:01:32.459 align:start size:94% position:6%
to encourage people
to vote for Hillary.

00:01:32.459 --> 00:01:34.861 align:start size:94% position:6%
Clearly that worked a treat.
-Yeah.

00:01:34.861 --> 00:01:35.395 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:35.395 --> 00:01:36.096 size:75% position:38% line:92%
You struck out hard.

00:01:36.096 --> 00:01:38.531 align:start size:94% position:6%
People still blame
you guys for it. Yeah.

00:01:38.531 --> 00:01:39.099 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:39.099 --> 00:01:40.900 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I know.
She's not speaking to us.

00:01:40.900 --> 00:01:41.334 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah.

00:01:41.334 --> 00:01:42.535
-That's why she did Murphy's --
the Murphy show.

00:01:42.535 --> 00:01:48.842 align:start size:94% position:6%
But then NBC saw it and said,
"We've got to have this."

00:01:48.842 --> 00:01:52.178
So the show became much more
political than it ever was.

00:01:52.178 --> 00:01:55.048 align:start size:94% position:6%
It was always very LGBTQ,
very cultural show,

00:01:55.048 --> 00:01:57.984 align:start size:94% position:6%
but it was never political,
and so, now we --

00:01:57.984 --> 00:02:01.287
we just did a show where
Jack and Will go to Texas

00:02:01.287 --> 00:02:03.990 align:start size:94% position:6%
