00:02:10.296 --> 00:02:11.631 size:78% position:39% line:92%
So we get to do that.

00:02:11.631 --> 00:02:13.399 line:92%
-There you go. Yeah, exactly.

00:02:13.399 --> 00:02:13.933 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah. Yeah.

00:02:13.933 --> 00:02:17.971
-Obviously people over the years
