00:02:38.858 --> 00:02:40.760 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I think he'd be game.
-He'd be great.

00:02:40.760 --> 00:02:43.429 size:81% position:41%
-I think he'd be game.
-He'd be down for it.

00:02:43.429 --> 00:02:44.931 line:92%
